# Cron job configuration for automatic skill monitoring
# This file contains scheduled tasks for Jarvis self-improvement system
# Run weekly: every Sunday at 02:00 AM

# Automatic skill search and analysis (weekly)
0 2 * * 0 cd /c/Users/Пользователь/AppData/Local/hermes/cache/scratch && python3 auto_monitor_skills.py >> /c/Users/Пользователь/AppData/Local/hermes/logs/auto-monitor-$(date +%Y-%m-%d).log 2>&1

# Description of scheduled tasks:
# - Weekly analysis of new skills on hermes-agent.nousresearch.com
# - Monitoring arxiv for AI self-improvement papers
# - Analysis of Hermes Agent documentation for expansion opportunities
# - Results saved to Obsidian wiki/technology/ and raw/
